				<wikidot:authorName>5150wned</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5175695</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Sadly, -1.</p> <blockquote> <p>SCP-905 shows an inability to absorb coloured lights.</p> </blockquote> <p>'Colored' lights are just lights of a single, uniform wavelength between 380 nm to 780 nm. There's no reason 905 would be unable to absorb a single wavelength if it can absorb multiple wavelengths.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
