				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-312264#post-2451802</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-312264/scp-905#post-2451802</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 05 Feb 2016 00:48:42 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>AJMansfield</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2238949</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>No, its not that there <em>shouldn't</em> be something made of photons by physics, its that photons aren't even a thing that something could be made of. If something is not always going at the speed of light relative to every other thing, it is by definition not a photon.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
